      "description_html": "<p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"b5ecad23-f5b3-4592-9347-58665d2223c1\"><strong>목적:</strong> 콘솔이 소비하는 공개 API v1 1차 구현.</p><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"4b536e00-5813-4ebb-ac1e-36c85947d831\"><strong>범위:</strong> 8.5장 — GET /overview(보호 상태 요약), GET /sessions/{id}/timeline, GET/PUT /policies·/policy-packs, GET/POST /approvals·/approvals/{id}/decision, POST /detect/preview, POST /attacklab/run/{scenarioId}. OpenAPI 스펙 문서화.</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-7 space-y-(--list-spacing-y) tight\" data-id=\"4f836140-abe5-4f63-8662-83eeea6202e5\" data-tight=\"true\"><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"5ab1a373-b1ca-474c-b968-b5d5520ec0c9\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"0b9ae848-960a-4d97-8583-64f98634d7d9\">SCR-000/101/301/302/401/402가 요구하는 필드 계약 충족</p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\" data-id=\"139ea60f-96eb-4694-9489-fdb8ad6fb94e\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"787c8fc8-81ac-45f9-ad58-1ede8d03965d\">API 스펙 문서가 저장소에 공개</p></li></ul>",
